When you get a wish, get some grey dragon scale mail.  Much nicer than crystal plate.
Also, it protects you from magic, including pmorph traps.


The bottom of the mines is really the bottom.  Somewhere in there is a secret room with a
door (ie. just search, don't dig).  My experience has been that it is somewhere in the
middle, not the edges, but that may just be chance.  The room has loads o' gems and a 
luckstone.  Then you climb back up all the stairs.  Did you notice, that on the level
you started into the mines from, there were _2_ sets of down stairs?  Take the other
after you exit the mines, that puts you back on track in the regular dungeon.

